{"speciesId":495,"names":{"fr":"Vipélierre","es":"Snivy","en":"Snivy","ja":"ツタージャ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Un Pokémon intelligent et très calme. Lorsqu’il a reçu suffisamment de lumière du soleil, il devient plus agile."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It is very intelligent and calm. Being exposed to lots of sunlight makes its movements swifter."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il laisse sa queue prendre le soleil pour sa photosynthèse. Quand il est malade, sa queue pend tristement."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"They photosynthesize by bathing their tails in sunlight. When they are not feeling well, their tails droop."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Being exposed to sunlight makes its movements swifter. It uses vines more adeptly than its hands."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Being exposed to sunlight makes its movements swifter. It uses vines more adeptly than its hands."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"La lumière du soleil augmente fortement son agilité. Ses lianes sont plus habiles que ses mains."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Cuando recibe los rayos de sol, se mueve mucho más rápido que de costumbre. Usa mejor sus lianas que sus manos."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Being exposed to sunlight makes its movements swifter. It uses vines more adeptly than its hands."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"太陽の 光を 浴びると いつもよりも 素早く 動ける。 手よりも ツルを うまく使う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il laisse sa queue prendre le soleil pour sa photosynthèse. Quand il est malade, sa queue pend tristement."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Sintetiza la luz del sol que recoge con su cola. Esta se le queda abatida cuando le fallan las energías."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"They photosynthesize by bathing their tails in sunlight. When they are not feeling well, their tails droop."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"尻尾で 太陽の光を